{{!
    @template local_oksigeniafamily/claim_done

    After a family claims a code: who they are family of now, and what each plugin gives them for that child.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * done - Who they are family of now.
    * linksheading - The heading of the links.
    * links - A list of { label, url, pin, note } from the plugins.
    * pinlabel - How the PIN is introduced.
    * haslinks - Whether there are any.
    * nolinks - What to say when there are none.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "done": "You are now family of Ana at Colegio Ejemplo.",
        "linksheading": "What you have now:",
        "links": [{ "label": "Canteen menu", "url": "https://example.com/local/oksigeniameals/k.php", "pin": "4826", "note": "" }],
        "pinlabel": "PIN",
        "haslinks": true,
        "nolinks": "The school will tell you how to go on."
    }
}}
<div class="local-oksigeniafamily-claimdone">
    <p class="lead">{{done}}</p>
    {{#haslinks}}
    <h3 class="h5">{{linksheading}}</h3>
    <ul class="list-unstyled">
        {{#links}}
        <li class="mb-3">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>
            {{#pin}}<div class="mt-1">{{pinlabel}}: <strong class="text-monospace">{{pin}}</strong></div>{{/pin}}
            {{#note}}<div class="form-text">{{note}}</div>{{/note}}
        </li>
        {{/links}}
    </ul>
    {{/haslinks}}
    {{^haslinks}}
    <p>{{nolinks}}</p>
    {{/haslinks}}
</div>
